<title>JAPAN: JGBs edge up on buying back, still off highs.</title>
<headline>JGBs edge up on buying back, still off highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>*JGBs edged slightly higher in mid-afternoon on buying back but still were off earlier highs, although tone remained fundamentally strong.</p>
<p>*Futures gathering strength for try at key 127 level, where outstanding call options lining up.</p>
</text>
